y":"Desserts","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7KZ4kSUEh9r2o9Zs2emA6w","review_id":"33nic7SEzv3ChXdATNK2Pw","date":"2021-10-05T00:25:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9239785075187683,"text_excerpt":"With a limited of ice cream/frozen treat shops in the Quarter this is such a nice and surprising find. The blueberry custard was very flavorful and rich & creamy. The chocolate milkshake was just as delish and a toss up between the two. Our server was extremely pleasant and personable. It was nice to be able to sample the flavors to try before you buy. We will definitely be adding this to the list of places to go for tasty treats."},{"business_id":"7KZ4kSUEh9r2o9Zs2emA6w","review_id":"tTay9pcygRsKBa3zAWwFHg","date":"2021-06-14T11:46:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9211281538009644,"text_excerpt":"Staff was courteous. They churn out a few select batches a day. Got the bananas foster and chocolate almond. Omg, they were heavenly!!! So rich, creamy and delectable! Frozen custard is like if gelato and ice cream had a secret love child. Only downside, it's in the heart of FQ. You'll have to dodge a bunch of drunk morons to get here."},{"business_id":"7KZ4kSUEh9r2o9Zs2emA6w","review_id":"qT_ieiyTMYdQSF30XWiqIw","date":"2020-09-25T20:51:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9174119234085083,"text_excerpt":"Love, love, love! Great service and amazing menu. I ordered the mudslide custard with snickers in a waffle bowl - Yaaaas! My husband ordered chocolate custard in a waffle bowl and said it was equally as delicious. Honestly, they were both over the top delicious. Bonus is that the staff was super patient explaining the menu, and offering samples as well as suggestions. I got a loyalty card while I was there, and I can't wait to go back to get it stamped again. Highly recommend this place. Stop by next time you're in the quarter."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7KZ4kSUEh9r2o9Zs2emA6w","photo_id":"rMkJ1RoeUtVFIfa13nLhMQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rMkJ1RoeUtVFIfa13nLhMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9047601819038391},{"business_id":"7KZ4kSUEh9r2o9Zs2emA6w","photo_id":"8dC20AtdJtW0qZxVRvk5Wg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/8dC20AtdJtW0qZxVRvk5Wg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9047600626945496}]},"notebook_case":null}
